# This repository ships ONLY the AutoMagFeeder addon and the Magatama release.
# Everything else (the rest of the addon pack, IDE/editor files, etc.) is ignored.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the root, then re-include just what we want.

# 1. Ignore everything at the repository root...
/*

# 2. ...except these infrastructure files and the two payloads we ship.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Magatama_Release.zip
!/addons/

# 3. Inside addons/, ignore every sibling addon (solylib, core_*, Item Reader, ...).
/addons/*

# 4. ...and keep only AutoMagFeeder.
!/addons/AutoMagFeeder/

# Note: addons/AutoMagFeeder/options.lua is still ignored (per-user, regenerated at
# runtime) — see addons/AutoMagFeeder/README.md.
/addons/AutoMagFeeder/options.lua
